# Build-context WHITELIST for linux/docker/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next
# to the Dockerfile). Everything is excluded except the files the build reads: no source code,
# checkpoints, data or secrets (work/meaf, keys, tokens) can reach the builder, even when the
# context is the whole project root. Add a line here only for a file the Dockerfile really needs.
*
!linux/requirements.txt
!rust/enclosure-bot/Cargo.toml
!rust/enclosure-bot/Cargo.lock
!rust/game-import/Cargo.toml
!rust/game-import/Cargo.lock
!work/external/convert/extconv/Cargo.toml
!work/external/convert/extconv/Cargo.lock
!work/constellation/meridian-bot-kit/engine/Cargo.toml
!work/constellation/meridian-bot-kit/scout/Cargo.toml
